5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's begin calmly. Since it's the first day, we have no information. I suggest we observe each other's reactions for now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us be kind to one another while we search for the truth.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Logic is our best tool here. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in your statements as the days progress.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most prudent approach. I shall endeavor to maintain a level of decorum while we unravel this little mystery together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! This sounds like a fun challenge! I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,Thank you. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose for the coming days?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps we can simply share our thoughts openly? A warm heart often leads to the truth.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Openness is fine, but we must remain vigilant. The Possessed will try to blend in perfectly with the humans.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Mizuki. The art of deception is often hidden behind a mask of perfect agreement. How fascinating.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with Mizuki! We have to be careful, but I'm sure we can figure it out if we work together!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,I agree with Mizuki. We should look for patterns of behavior rather than just trusting words.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very sensible way to look at it, Minako dear. I trust your judgment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have no clues yet, I'll spend this turn observing. I'm curious to see who tries to lead the conversation.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,I find the silence of the observant quite telling. I shall simply enjoy the atmosphere for a moment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just excited to see what happens tomorrow! I wonder who the Seer is?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"For today, I believe we have established a basic understanding. Let's move to the night phase.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
