25,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A lovely sentiment. I shall retire now. Goodnight to you all.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight! I can't wait for tomorrow!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
