42,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I think Benjamin is just being fancy! I don't think he's the bad guy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I've noticed Kenji is very quick to defend others. While it seems friendly, it can be a tactic.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
