47,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I just like everyone! Is that a crime? I just want us all to be friends!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We have no hard evidence, but the dynamics are forming. I suspect the werewolf is playing a passive role.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is a difficult position to be in. I feel for whoever is feeling anxious right now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I've observed enough for today. Benjamin's deflection and Kenji's over-friendliness are the only anomalies. I'll vote based on logic.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic is a fickle thing when the data is scarce. I shall cast my vote with a heavy heart.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want anyone to get executed! But if we have to, I'll follow the group!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
